# spore-as-project (dogfood) harness artifacts
/state.md
# Skills installed by `repo-mapped` from the spore binary's BundledSkills
# embed. Source lives at bootstrap/skills/, so committing this snapshot
# would create a drift target. Downstream consumers (no embed source
# in-tree) commit their .claude/skills/; spore-as-project does not.
/.claude/skills/

# local secrets (never commit)
secrets.env
*.local.nix
*linear*key*
# ...but agenix-encrypted secrets ARE safe to commit (the plaintext
# never is). Re-include the encrypted .age files under secrets/, which
# the broad *linear*key* guard above would otherwise also catch.
!/secrets/*.age
